      <div class="brand-guidelines">
        <div class="brand-guideline">
          <h3>Do</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Use the white logo on dark backgrounds.</li>
            <li>Keep a healthy margin around the mark.</li>
            <li>Scale proportionally without distortion.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="brand-guideline">
          <h3>Don’t</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Change colors or add shadows.</li>
            <li>Place the logo on busy imagery.</li>
            <li>Recreate the wordmark in other fonts.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
